---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout slug="msc-recharged" mainClass="partners-page">
    <section class="partners-root" aria-label="Recharged">
      <article class="content-box">
        <div class="content-box-top" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="content-box-top-left"></div>
          <div class="content-box-top-main"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="content-box-center">
          <div class="content-box-texture" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="content-box-content competitive-rules">

            <h1 class="about-page-title">Recharged — a native PC port of Mario Strikers Charged</h1>

            <p>Play Mario Strikers Charged natively on Windows, Linux, macOS and Steam Deck. Recharged compiles the reconstructed source code of the original Wii game into a real PC program. It is not an emulator: the game's own code runs unchanged, and Recharged supplies what the Wii hardware used to provide: graphics, sound, controllers, disc access and saves.</p>

            <h3>GitHub / Download</h3>
            <p><a class="cr-link cr-link-preserve-case" href="https://github.com/previouslevelgames/recharged" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/<wbr>previouslevelgames/recharged</a></p>

          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="content-box-bottom" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </article>
    </section>
  </SiteLayout>
